itrary additional information independent of (U_1,...,U_r), outputs (P(U_1),...,P(U_r)) with probability <=beta^r.","statement_sha256":"0709f485909bd9d99e388ffd62a383db25fa3581f3580f9940d2dd2b12c7b173"}
